WEBVTT

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.530
No!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.970
I am Furuya Chihiro,

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:42.800
a first year student at Shiyou High.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:54.980
What a waste!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.780
From a very young age, I've loved zombies a lot.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:00.030
I love the graphics.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:11.870
Since I was small, I've been dreaming of a romantic situation with a zombie girl.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:14.340
S-Stop.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:21.180
Even though we're zombies, please stop killing us indiscriminately.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.100
Not going to happen!

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.480
What kind of a hobby is that?

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.560
What?

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.060
I can't help it.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.360
Anyway, it's fine this way.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.320
In what sense is it fine?!

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:41.450
It's like my heart is being comforted.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:50.660
Furuya-kun is probably feeling pity for people who have been brought back from the dead.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:51.580
Aren't you?

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.210
I am absolutely sure it's different in his case.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:56.130
Eh, really?

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:00.130
It is true that it's different, but it's not like that at all.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:05.510
I like them no matter what, to an extent I can't even explain.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.390
Shiryou Temple.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:14.400
My family's house is a historic temple.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.610
This is my grandpa, Jogorou.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.780
My dad, Don, the head priest.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.620
My younger sister Mero, 12 years old.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.650
Although my dad prepares the meals,

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:30.830
she does the rest of the household chores.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.660
Let's eat.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.380
Mero, did you stop adding Chinese cabbage to the miso soup?

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.050
Grandpa, that is cabbage.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.880
Eh?! Really?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:47.850
This is Babu, a stray cat that got lost in our temple.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.180
I took him in and made him a family member.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.230
Mero, did you stop adding Chinese cabbage to the miso soup?

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.480
Grandpa, that is cabbage.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:00.370
Eh?!

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:04.360
Grandpa's in this condition, but I still think we are a happy family.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.160
One other thing...

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.080
My mum died when I was small.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.660
I don't have many memories about her.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:14.660
So this is my family.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.500
I'm satisfied with it, and I haven't been lonely before.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:22.590
However, one day, we suddenly lost one family member.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.930
Babu!

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.930
C-Chihiro-kun, I...

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:37.520
He suddenly came out into the road, and I couldn't stop in time.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.900
He was an elderly neighbour I've known from childhood.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:45.030
All I could do was cry because I didn't know how to cope with it.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.030
Babu!

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.490
I am really sorry.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.790
We cannot have a memorial service for an animal in the temple.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:00.330
Even within the parishioners, there are still some annoying people who are against it.

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.340
Please bear with it.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.350
Nii.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.680
Hm?

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:20.560
Do children from this temple have to be
strong even when things like this happen?

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.650
Of course not.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:25.320
I see.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:44.460
It never occurred to me that the death of someone who was alive this morning could be this sad.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.260
Or rather, no one should die.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.720
How can this happen?

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:54.350
A certain thought comes to my mind.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:56.560
Here it is.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.100
Last year, I visited a relative living in Tohoku,

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:04.440
and helped to organise documents received from the Museum of Local History.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.860
And I found this.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.570
This is more like a manuscript than a book.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.990
I have no idea when it was written.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:14.370
Although the curator of the museum thought it was useless...

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.540
I think I know what this is.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.870
This is a manuscript related to the art of resurrection.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:24.540
Although it might be a load of rubbish, it's still worth trying.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.060
People in our hometown rarely visit this place.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.140
No one will bother us here.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:45.270
Yes, I am a zombie lover.

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:48.070
Even if you turn into a zombie, I will still love you.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.740
So come back to life, Babu!

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.540
And two days later...

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:17.930
No!

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:37.490
Nii.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.290
What are you doing?

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:44.330
N-Nothing.

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:46.830
It doesn't seem like "nothing" to me.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:49.340
You can't fool your younger sister.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.920
When I say "nothing", it really means "nothing".

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.470
Suspicious.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.690
I'm off.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:18.620
Hey, are you listening, Furuya?!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.350
What?

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:23.620
I'm listening.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.400
Oh, really?!

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:28.040
You are definitely lying with a face like that.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:30.090
No way I am.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.000
So, what do you think about it then?

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.550
About what?

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.130
As expected, you weren't listening.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.760
It's about our high school and Sanka Girls' Academy.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.890
What about Sanka High?

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:46.230
Sanka Girls' Academy is one of the few
all-girls schools in the prefecture,

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:49.730
while our high school is full of boys with no character.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:54.490
Even so, why are our school paths completely separated?

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:57.240
We're companions separated by the river. Isn't that good enough?

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.780
Of course not.

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:03.620
I actually chose this school just because Sanka High is nearby.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:08.120
I thought I would be able to walk to school with those girls.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:08.960
Oh, I see.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.590
Do you know that this year is special?

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.920
A very famous girl entered their school.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.550
Look, look! Over there...

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:19.340
That girl with long, black hair.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:27.020
The daughter of the principal of Sanka Girls' Academy, Sanka Rea-tan!

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.860
Isn't that good?!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.940
So pure, so humble...

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:41.530
As expected, when the parents are splendid, their daughter would be raised like that.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.740
It might not turn out to be like that...

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.790
What?! Why are you talking like you know about it?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:55.750
Hello!

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.210
Hi, Ranko-chan.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:00.510
Thanks for helping out,

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:04.720
since Mero has lessons at school, and will be late.

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.890
Call us any time, mister.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.390
I'll leave my customers, and rush over.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.650
Thank you.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.270
By the way, where's Chihiro?

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.360
I guess he's sleeping in his room.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.150
Sleeping?

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:21.450
He seems to be very tired since Babu passed away.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.240
He'd go and sleep right after he comes home.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.990
Really?

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.330
Chihiro!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.420
Oh, Wanko.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.380
I told you to add "-san".

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:37.710
Here!

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:42.050
Oh, I did lend you this DVD.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.470
As I thought, you forgot about it.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:47.180
I told you to come over at the weekend to take it back, right?

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:51.350
Well... I was kind of busy...

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.390
Busy at what?!

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:57.010
Anyway, that DVD was very interesting.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.650
By the way, Wanko.

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.360
I told you to add "-san".

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:04.450
Hey, Wanko-san.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.240
What?!

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.870
Do you know about the first year student Sanka Rea?

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.000
Y-Yeah, I know her.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.420
What kind of girl is she?

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.750
What kind of girl...

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:20.420
Since she is the principal's daughter, I know what she looks like.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:21.760
But that's all I know.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:23.630
Why do you want to know about her?

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:26.180
Falling in love with her?!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:28.430
No, no. It's not like that.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:32.310
I'm only interested in the information. That's all-

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.560
I thought you'd be depressed since Babu died.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.020
I guess you're totally fine.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:37.730
I am fine.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.650
I am doing fine!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.160
All right, see you later.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.160
Okay.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:53.290
Come over to my place this weekend.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.750
Big sis will once again give you plenty of <i>service!</i>

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.670
Geez...

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.010
Remember to lend me some more zombie DVDs!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.470
If that's what you want, take them now!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.810
Sorry for disturbing you.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:15.560
Saoji Ranko is my cousin.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.400
She lives in the Kyoukaiseki restaurant.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:18.980
She's a second year at Sanka Girls' Academy.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.850
Our birthdays are only half a year apart.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:24.570
How can she act like my older sister?

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.450
Sanka Rea-san.

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.340
Oh... Oh no.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.300
Maybe it's a good idea to make a copy of it.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:58.020
There is one part that I can't read at all.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.110
It seems like some kind of poisonous herb is required,

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.030
but I have no idea what it is.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:07.030
Yesterday, I tried using cowbane, but it didn't seem to work well.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:16.460
Maybe it <i>is</i> impossible.

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:19.000
It's too pitiful to leave Babu in such a state.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.540
If I don't make any progress this week, I'll bury him...

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.570
It begins...

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.780
No!

00:14:55.120 --> 00:15:00.120
Why did I have to be born into the Sanka family?!

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:09.630
I want to go out freely with the others as well!

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:16.390
Why is the daughter of the Sanka
family not allowed to go outside alone?

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:21.690
I'm already a high school student...

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.860
A lot of suppressed feelings again today.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:30.490
And also, to be honest, I really want you to stop...

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:34.450
Father... you...

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:39.660
...need to stop measuring my growth each birthday...

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.370
...by taking nude pictures of me!

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:11.240
This isn't good.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:16.700
Ah... You're from Sanka High-

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.620
I-I will do anything you want,

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:28.710
so please... don't tell anyone... about... what happened today.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.140
In that case...

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.520
...is it okay to tell about yesterday?

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.320
I was seen yesterday as well?

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:51.940
Would it be better if I hadn't told you?

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:54.910
Ah... I want to die.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:56.990
It'd be so much better if I were dead.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:01.660
I want to die and be reborn as a different person.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:06.420
Well, I don't know what's happened,

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:10.800
but it must be hard on someone like you, with such a good family background.

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:16.010
I guess you're forced to behave yourself around others,
and suppress your feelings,

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:19.510
not even able to say "no" to what you dislike.

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:23.520
With a life like that, I guess it's normal to go and scream in a deserted place from time to time.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:28.310
By the way, do you come here to scream as well?

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.900
No, no, no.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.280
R-Resurrection?!

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:34.960
Incredible!

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.400
Stuff like that...

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:40.130
But based on my prediction, even if I can bring him back to life,

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:43.620
he might only wander around like a zombie.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:45.410
Zombie...

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:50.920
It's true that Babu might not be happy in a condition like that,

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:56.420
but I want to see him move once again.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:01.430
In other words, I am just forcing my selfishness on Babu.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:05.390
I am sure this is only a bother to Babu.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.190
T-That's not true!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:12.190
I'm sure Babu-chan wants to see you once more.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:14.690
How defenceless...

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.450
By the way, what is your name?

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.660
Furuya.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.410
Furuya... san?

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:27.330
Well, in the first place, we don't even know if the drug can be made or not.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:31.460
Then, from now on, please let me help you.

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:36.210
What? Come on, for a lady like you to do something so smelly...

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:39.250
Since my father is obsessed with cleanliness,

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.890
I can't keep a pet in my house.

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:46.520
That's why I'd like to give my love to an animal for once as well.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:54.570
Oh, but if I slow down your progress, then it doesn't matter.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.440
Nah, it's fine.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:01.780
Earlier, you did say that you would do anything I want, right?

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.780
Y-Yes.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.040
In that case,

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.750
for the sake of Babu,

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.170
be my experimental subject.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.460
Does that mean...

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:18.720
You want to die and become someone different, right?

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:20.340
So...

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:22.720
...why not be a zombie?

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.520
I'm just kidding!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.820
As expected of a pure and naive lady!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.990
She believes everything I say.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:42.940
You better be careful around boys!

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:46.160
You look like you'd get tricked very easily.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.950
S-So rude, I...

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:52.170
Although I...

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:56.040
...have not been in a relationship...

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.300
...with any boys before,

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.090
I'm sure I'd be fine.

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:03.340
My lady, you have a strange but high sense of pride.

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:09.180
So Furuya-kun, what about you?

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.230
Me?

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:13.400
Do... you have a girlfriend?

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.770
I don't have one.

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:19.110
So you are in no position to lecture me on this subject, right?

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:24.700
I have no interest in living girls.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:25.280
What?

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:28.580
I won't go out with anyone who isn't a zombie.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.160
Eh?

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.460
You think it's a joke, right?

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:35.130
I'm being serious.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:37.710
I've been like that since I was small.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:42.760
I want to date a zombie girl, but it's hard to find one...

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.970
Or rather, there aren't any.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.220
I know that.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.850
Sad?

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.270
But it's true.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:57.940
Then...

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:58.770
Eh?

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:07.370
If I become a zombie, you will take responsibility, right?

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:13.370
Eh, uh, well...

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:22.880
Please consider it, okay?

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:27.010
I have to go home soon.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.850
Crap. I feel like I've just been beaten.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.060
Oh, by the way,

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:38.270
you'll be here tomorrow as well, right?

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:40.400
Furuya-kun~!

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:44.860
I didn't see it even in my wildest dreams, but at that moment,

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:51.790
this girl really has...

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:57.790
Fu-ru-ya-kun.

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:04.920
...become a zombie.

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:43.310
This?

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:46.150
Is this really all right?!

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.900
Eh? Are you sure?

00:23:50.480 --> 00:23:53.030
Can you talk with the one who writes here?

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:54.910
You can't.

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:59.540
In that case, I'm going to do the preview.

00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:01.210
Next time: Sankarea.

